@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Claim Review, Approval & Physical Handover

autonumber
actor "Campus Administrator" as Admin
participant "Admin Portal\n(AdminClaims / Handovers)" as UI
participant "PostgreSQL DB" as DB
actor "Claimant Student" as Claimant
actor "Student Finder" as Finder

== Stage 1: Administrative Claim Review ==
Admin -> UI: Open /admin/claims -> Select pending claim
UI -> DB: Query claim joined with claimant profile and item
DB --> UI: Return claimant roll, name, proof details & evidence photo
Admin -> Admin: Cross-examine proof with physical item

alt Claim Approved
    Admin -> UI: Click "Approve Claim" + enter review note
    UI -> DB: UPDATE claims SET status='awaiting_handover', reviewed_by=admin.id WHERE id = claim.id
    UI -> DB: UPDATE items SET status='claimed' WHERE id = claim.item_id
    UI -> DB: UPDATE claims SET status='rejected' WHERE item_id = claim.item_id AND id != claim.id (Reject competing claims)
    UI -> DB: INSERT into audit_logs (action='claim_approved', performed_by=admin.id, entity_type='claim')
    UI -> DB: INSERT into notifications (user_id=claimant.id, type='claim_approved', title='Claim Approved!')
    DB --> Claimant: Notification: "Claim approved. Proceed to desk for handover."
else Claim Rejected
    Admin -> UI: Click "Reject Claim" + enter feedback message
    UI -> DB: UPDATE claims SET status='rejected', admin_message=msg WHERE id = claim.id
    UI -> DB: INSERT into audit_logs (action='claim_rejected', performed_by=admin.id, entity_type='claim')
    UI -> DB: INSERT into notifications (user_id=claimant.id, type='claim_rejected')
    DB --> Claimant: Notification: "Claim rejected."
end

== Stage 2: Physical Handover at Campus Desk ==
Claimant -> Admin: Arrive at desk; present physical IIITA Student ID card
Admin -> UI: Open /admin/handovers -> Click "Record Handover"
Admin -> UI: Input verified Recipient Name & Roll Number
Admin -> UI: Click "Confirm Physical Handover"

UI -> DB: UPDATE claims SET status='returned', handover_confirmed_at=now(), recipient_roll_number=roll
UI -> DB: UPDATE items SET status='returned'
UI -> DB: INSERT into audit_logs (action='handover_confirmed', entity_type='claim', details={recipient_roll: roll})
UI -> DB: INSERT into notifications (user_id=claimant.id, type='item_returned')
UI -> DB: INSERT into notifications (user_id=finder.id, type='item_returned', title='Item Resolved')

DB --> Claimant: Real-time notification: "Handover completed"
DB --> Finder: Real-time notification: "Item you found has been returned"
UI --> Admin: Handover finalized and saved in ledger

@enduml
